␀␀<button onpointerdown="gf('Fh')" type='button'>&#x27A5;&#x1F3E0; Return Home</button><button onpointerdown="if (confirm('Are you sure?')) gf('FH')" type='button'>&#9888;&#x1F3E0; Home (Reset)</button>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;␀␀␀␀</div>
