␀␀<br /><bigger><font class="y">Serial Interface to OnStep is Down!</font></bigger><br /><br />If you just rebooted OnStep please wait for several seconds for everything to startup again, then check to be sure you're still connected to WiFi.If this is a persistant problem here are other possible causes:<br /><ul> <li>Baud rate mismatch due to reboot of only OnStep, power everything off/on again.</li><br /> <li>Incorrectly configured SWS baud rate.</li><br /> <li>Incorrectly configured OnStep baud rate.</li><br /> <li>Incorrect wiring of the com ports.</li><br /> <li>Incorrect wiring of power supply pins.  Gnd must be shared between OnStep's MCU and the Addon's MCU.</li><br /><br /><form method='get' action='/configuration.htm'><button name='advanced' type='submit' value='reset' onclick="return confirm('Are you sure?');" >Reboot OnStep</button></form>
</ul></div><br class="clear" />
␀␀␀</STYLE>␀␀␀␀.collapsible { background: var(--card-hi); color: var(--fg); cursor: pointer; padding: 7px 12px; width: 100%; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 8px; text-align: left; font-size: 13px; margin: 2px 0; } .collapsible::before { content: '\25B8'; display: inline-block; width: 1.2em; color: var(--accent); } .collapsible.active::before { content: '\25BE'; } .active, .collapsible:hover { background: var(--sel); color: var(--fg-hi); } .content { padding: 4px 14px; display: none; overflow: hidden; background: #110809; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-top: none; border-radius: 0 0 8px 8px; margin-top: -4px; }␀␀.b1 { float: left; background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px; text-align: center; margin: 8px; padding: 12px 16px 14px; } .b1 > hr:last-child { display: none; } .b1 > div:first-child { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--fg-hi); } .b1 > div:first-child .c { letter-spacing: normal; text-transform: none; } .b1 > div[style*='float: right'] { font-size: 12px; padding: 1px 10px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--sel); } .gb { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600; width: 64px; height: 56px; padding: 0; margin: 3px; border-radius: 14px; touch-action: none; -webkit-touch-callout: none; } .bb { font-weight: 600; font-size: 105%; } .bbh { font-weight: 600; height: 2.2em; min-width: 5em; touch-action: none; -webkit-touch-callout: none; }␀.btns_left, .btns_mid, .btns_right { padding: 4px 9px; font-size: 13px; }.bbh.btns_left, .bbh.btns_mid, .bbh.btns_right { padding: 4px 16px; font-size: 15px; }.btns_left { margin-left: -1px; border-top-left-radius: 0px; border-bottom-left-radius: 0px; }.btns_mid { margin-left: -1px; margin-right: -1px; border-radius: 0px; }.btns_right { margin-right: -1px; border-top-right-radius: 0px; border-bottom-right-radius: 0px; }␀body { -webkit-user-select: none; -moz-user-select: none; -ms-user-select: none; user-select: none; }␀␀␀:root { --bg: #0B0607; --fg: #B48A8A; --fg-hi: #C9A0A0; --alert: #FF7043;--card: #150A0B; --card-hi: #1D0F10; --line: #3A1719; --link: #C08080;--accent: #D03232; --sel: #3A1416; --off: #5A3A3B; }* { box-sizing: border-box; } body { margin: 0; background: var(--bg); color: var(--fg); font: 15px/1.5 'Segoe UI', system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, sans-serif; } .clear { clear: both; } .a { background-color: var(--card); } .hdr { position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 10; background: var(--card); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 0 24px; } .hdr-row { display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; padding: 12px 0 6px; } .brand { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--fg-hi); letter-spacing: .02em; } .meta { font-size: 12px; color: var(--fg); opacity: .7; } .tabs { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px; } .tabs a:link, .tabs a:visited { background: none; border: none; border-bottom: 2px solid transparent; border-radius: 0; color: var(--fg); padding: 8px 14px; margin: 0; } .tabs a:hover { background: var(--card-hi); color: var(--fg-hi); } .tabs a.on { color: var(--fg-hi); border-bottom-color: var(--accent); } .t { margin: 0; padding: 12px 24px; background: var(--card); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); } .b { max-width: 1440px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 16px 16px 32px; } hr { border: none; height: 1px; background: var(--line); margin: 10px 0; } h1 { text-align: right; } .c { color: var(--accent); font-weight: 600; } .y { color: var(--alert); font-weight: 600; } a:link, a:visited { background: var(--card-hi); color: var(--link); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 6px; padding: 5px 12px; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; } a:hover, a:active { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--fg-hi); } input, select, textarea { font: inherit; font-weight: 600; color: var(--fg-hi); background: var(--bg); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 6px; padding: 3px 6px; margin: 3px; text-align: center; width: 5em; } select { width: auto; text-align: left; } input[type=range] { border: none; background: none; padding: 0; accent-color: var(--accent); } input:focus, select:focus, textarea:focus { outline: none; border-color: var(--accent); } button { font: inherit; font-weight: 600; color: var(--accent); background: var(--card-hi); border: 1px solid var(--accent); border-radius: 8px; margin: 2px; padding: 4px 12px; cursor: pointer; } button:hover { background: var(--sel); } button:active, button.sel { background: var(--accent); color: var(--bg); } button:disabled { color: var(--off); border-color: var(--line); background: none; cursor: default; }␀<STYLE>␀</div></body></html>
