␀␀c_goto␀␀bzr_off␀bzr_on␀␀mfa_off␀mfa_on␀␀mfp_off␀mfp_on␀␀sr_vf␀␀␀sr_f␀␀␀␀sr_n␀␀␀␀sr_s␀␀␀␀sr_vs␀␀␀trk_off␀trk_on␀␀alg1␀␀␀␀alg2␀␀␀␀alg3␀␀␀␀alga␀␀␀␀rpa␀␀␀␀␀trk_sid␀trk_sol␀trk_lun␀ot_on␀␀␀ot_ref␀␀ot_off␀␀ot_dul␀␀ot_sgl␀␀date_ut␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀time_ut␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀time_lst␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀site_long␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀site_lat␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀pier_side␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀idx_a1␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀idx_a2␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀tgt_a1␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀tgt_a2␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀track␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀align_progress␀␀␀␀align_lr␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀align_ud␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Steps per worm rotation:<br /><input style='width: 7em;' value='%ld' type='number' name='spwr' min='%d' max='%ld' step='1'><br />
␀␀<br /><button onpointerdown="if (confirm('Are you sure?')) s('pec','wrt')" type='submit'>Write to EEPROM</button><br />Writes PEC data to EEPROM so it's remembered if OnStep is restarted.  Writing the data can take a few seconds.<br />␀Clear erases the memory buffer not EEPROM.  During recording corrections are averaged 3:1 favoring the buffer unless cleared in which case the full correction is used.<br />␀␀␀<button onpointerdown="s('pec','stop')" type='submit'>Stop</button><br /><br /><button onpointerdown="if (confirm('Are you sure?')) s('pec','clr')" type='submit'>Clear</button><button onpointerdown="if (confirm('Are you sure?')) s('pec','rec')" type='submit'>Record</button><br />␀␀␀␀<button onpointerdown="s('pec','play')" type='submit'>Play</button>␀<div style='float: left'>Status:</div><br/><div id='pec_sta'>?</div>␀␀␀␀</form>
␀␀␀␀<form method='get' action='/%s'>
␀␀␀<br /></div></div>
